  "ruleText": "Plc 404.04 Completion of Inspection Checklist and Inspection Report. The inspector shall complete the inspection checklist and compile an inspection report as provided in Plc 403.08 and Plc 403.09.\n\nSource. #14031, eff 8-15-24",
